{
  "body_human_readable": "Here are the GDP growth forecasts for 2023 and 2024 for India, China, United States, Brazil, and Japan, based on the latest World Economic Outlook data:\n\n**India**\n- 2023: 6.7%\n- 2024: 6.5% [1]\n\n**China**\n- 2023: 5.2%\n- 2024: 4.6% [1]\n\n**United States**\n- 2023: 2.5%\n- 2024: 2.1% [1]\n\n**Brazil**\n- 2023: 3.0%\n- 2024: 2.2% [1]\n\n**Japan**\n- 2023: 1.9%\n- 2024: 0.9% [1]\n\nAll values are year-over-year percent changes in real GDP.",
